[
    {
        "content": "<p>I am trying to give a default value for a data carrying function that relies on presence of a parent class. And it work fine! If I am trying to assign a new structure field. But if I am trying to override a parent, then it fails. Is this expected?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- like a positive-nat pow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultP</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- like Semigroup</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultP</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">N</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- like a nat pow</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultPAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultP</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Assume S X here, because otherwise defaultP and defaultPBin don't agree</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultPBin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultNAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultN</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Assume S X here, because otherwise defaultN and defaultNBin don't agree</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultNBin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">csimp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultPAuto_eq_defaultP</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">defaultPAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">defaultPBin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">csimp</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultNAuto_eq_defaultN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">defaultNAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">@</span><span class=\"n\">defaultNBin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- error: failed to synthesize instance of type class</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  S X-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">substring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">extends</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">N</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- like Monoid</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultNAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- this does not complain</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">defaultPAuto</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- this is what complains</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 609301079,
